  "rationale": "P1 of the second front forward, data-informed and not blind (written after the aggregate validation tables of D1 and D2): the carried D1 numbers with the narrow sample corrected from two burns of the earlier BASS campaign, which belongs to no partition (speed power -0.5 and overhang power +1.0 in place of the assumed -1 for both). For the wide sample it is D1 exactly. A slower growth of the flame, a weaker oxygen dependence and flow paths were typed as well, made the train burns worse and were not taken. Every number typed by the author; no fit, no search; the sealed validation tracks were not opened.",
